# Compose `c_ompose` (B6, F9): the nearest operand applies first, so
# `'n_eg 'a_bs c_ompose x` is `n_eg a_bs x`.
== SOURCE
'n_eg 'a_bs c_ompose 3 -4
'{ _r * 10 } '{ _r + 1 } c_ompose 2
u:n_abs := { x -> 'n_eg 'a_bs c_ompose x }
u:n_abs -7
'f_loat 't_ally c_ompose 1 2 3
